# Feature: Age_gap_normalized 
# Feature description: Normalized ratio of 'Driver_age_casualty_age_diff' to sum of both ages, preventing bias for larger age differences.
# Usefulness: Normalizing age gaps by their proportion offers insights into driver-casualty relationships while managing wide variance of ages.
df['Age_gap_normalized'] = df['Driver_age_casualty_age_diff'] / (df['Age_of_Driver'] + df['Age_of_Casualty'] + 1e-5)
end

