# Feature: Z_score_Accident_severity
# Feature description: Compute standardized z-score of the Accident_severity_factor.
# Usefulness: Standardizing helps reduce skewness in data and enables ML models to better utilize its scale. Accident severity is likely correlated with the driver's response style, influenced by their characteristics.
df['Z_score_Accident_severity'] = (df['Accident_severity_factor'] - df['Accident_severity_factor'].mean()) / df['Accident_severity_factor'].std()
end

