_diff'].std()", "# Vehicle_Type_Casualty_interaction\n# Feature description: Combines 'Vehicle_Type_binary' with 'Sex_of_Casualty' to capture specific interactions between the type of vehicle and casualty's sex.\n# Usefulness: May uncover relationships between vehicle choice and casualty sex, offering predictive insights into driver sex.\ndf['Vehicle_Type_Casualty_interaction'] = df['Vehicle_Type_binary'].astype(str) + '_' + df['Sex_of_Casualty'].astype(str)", "# Age_Driver_Capacity_ratio\n# Feature description: Ratio of 'Age_of_Driver' to 'Engine_Capacity_(CC)', assessing how age dynamics vary by engine size.\n# Usefulness: Captures age-related propensity trends for operating larger or smaller vehicles, which could correlate with driver sex.\ndf['Age_Driver_Capacity_ratio'] = df['Age_of_Driver'] / (df['Engine_Capacity_(CC)'] + 1)  # Adding 1 to prevent division by zero", "# Z_score_Local_Authority_District\n# Feature description: Computes z-score normalization for 'Local_Authority_(District)' to standardize geographic distribution impact on driver patterns.\n# Usefulness: Standardizes district effects for comparison across areas, removing bias to allow focus on driver-specific appraisals.\ndf['Z_score_Local_Authority_District'] = (df['Local_Authority_(District)'] - df['Local_Authority_(District)'].mean()) / df['Local_Authority_(District)'].std()", "# Engine_performance_vehicle_interaction_scaled\n# Feature description: Multiplies 'Engine_performance_per_vehicle' by 'Vehicle_Type_binary' to capture scaled performance differences in small vehicles.\n# Usefulness: Provides a focused lens on smaller, more common vehicles, potentially illuminating sex-driven patterns in vehicle handling.\ndf['Engine_performance_vehicle_interaction_scaled'] = df['Engine_performance_per_vehicle'] * df['Vehicle_Type_binary']", "# Interaction_Accident_severity_Local_Authority\n# Feature description: Multiplies 'Accident_severity_factor' by 'Z_score_Local_Authority_District' to assess severity-contextualized geographic differences.\n# Usefulness: Incorporates location and severity, providing nuanced insights into demographic factors potentially tied to driver sex.\ndf['Interaction_Accident_severity_Local_Authority'] = df['Accident_severity_factor'] * df['Z_score_Local_Authority_District']", "# Driver_age_severity_interaction\n# Feature description: Ratio between 'Age_of_Driver' and 'Accident_severity_factor' to assess how driver age influences accident severity.\n# Usefulness: Captures accident dynamics versus driver age—older and younger drivers may have distinct accident severity patterns associated with their sex.\ndf['Driver_age_severity_interaction'] = df['Age_of_Driver'] / (df['Accident_severity_factor'] + 1)  # Adding 1 to prevent division by zero", "# Drop redundant feature Engine_Capacity_zscore (already standardized, normalized features available)\ndf.drop(columns=['Engine_Capacity_zscore'], inplace=True)", "# Drop Casualty_Type (correlation not directly tied to driver sex and mostly concentrated at a single value)\ndf.drop(columns=['Casualty_Type'], inplace=True)", "# Drop Police_Force (administrative categorization unrelated to driver behavior or predictive modeling)\ndf.drop(columns=['Police_Force'], inplace=True)"]
